{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/c2d6c5965b211a06bdaaa530b6628adb.avif?t=1762900566\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the 'Breaker System', When a game of battle cards is turned into the primary means of battling back against the robot uprising. Build your deck, discover new strategies and combos as you seek to break down the system that now enslaves humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/8c229f7212070df725fc12e5d9517076.poster.avif?t=1762900566\" width=962 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/8c229f7212070df725fc12e5d9517076.webm?t=1762900566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/8c229f7212070df725fc12e5d9517076.mp4?t=1762900566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/1d90fe5bbb481f7c392d3ca3377fa827.avif?t=1762900566\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical grid-based combat as you battle waves of bots seeking to apprehend you and turn you over to the AI Mainframe. Battle multitudes of bot variations each with their own unique behaviours and capabilities, but know that they are as much as slave to the system as you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and perfect your deck through the mobile shop. Carefully select the cards you add, remove and even upgrade as you craft your battle plan and perfect your strategies. Don't forgot to throw in some powerful and quirky artefacts to bring about the ultimate power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/67abc9c94c7b92d4b006ebf4b8bf327d.poster.avif?t=1762900566\" width=930 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/67abc9c94c7b92d4b006ebf4b8bf327d.webm?t=1762900566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/67abc9c94c7b92d4b006ebf4b8bf327d.mp4?t=1762900566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/7c85881897b9a2de3bcc3711ea97a20b.avif?t=1762900566\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert your discarded cards into charge that can be utilised on powerful cards with the master of the 'Gamma-Blade'. Turn your cards themselves into ammunition and shoot them at your foes with the cannoneer. Hoard wealth like a dragon and go big or even play a delicate dance with a companion orb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Breaker bring a secondary pool of unique cards and artefacts that when fully utilised allow for new and different play styles. Who will you play, who will you master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/4bb435e0bea9e825235609a7888d02d0.poster.avif?t=1762900566\" width=968 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/4bb435e0bea9e825235609a7888d02d0.webm?t=1762900566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/4bb435e0bea9e825235609a7888d02d0.mp4?t=1762900566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same, your opponents, purchasable cards, take advantage of the randomness and find new ways to battle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933080?t=1762900566","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/000c4661c2ba91278dc4a3d6ce42f93ccce643ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762900566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/6a0c6e173c3930a59648ce3c774e8bc9fdd9d78a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762900566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/6a0c6e173c3930a59648ce3c774e8bc9fdd9d78a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762900566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4132490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Features</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933080/extras/c20f7e2f5c5dd185c01fdcb578d38b4b.avif?t=1762900566\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical grid based combat crossed with strategic deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_